:: documents/your-notes [document]
Day 14. Still no signal outside.
The city is quiet in the wrong way.
I heard someone on the street last night —
but they were moving wrong.

:: documents/neighbors-note [document]
They said it would pass in a week.
That was three weeks ago.
I'm staying inside until someone
comes to tell us it's over.

:: documents/wardens-log [document]
Entry 9: Three more on the east block.
They don't respond. They don't stop.
We sealed the outer gate at 0600.
I don't know if anyone outside knows.
